flowchart LR
  subgraph Inputs
    A1[Packet capture (wlan0) | ids_gateway.capture.py]
    A2[ESP32 MQTT telemetry | sensor/+/data]
    A3[Datasets | CIC-DDoS2019, BoT-IoT, CIC-IDS2017, ...]
    A4[Attack simulator | scripts/attack_sim/simulate_ddos.py]
  end

  A1 --> FE[Feature extraction | features.build_feature_vector()]
  A2 --> FE

  A3 --> PD[Prepare dataset | train/prepare_ids_dataset.py]
  PD --> DProcessed[data/processed/ids_features.csv]
  DProcessed --> TRAIN[Train models | train/train_ids_model.py\noutputs: model_stage1.joblib, model_stage2.joblib, feature_scaler.joblib]
  TRAIN --> ModelRegistry[Model Registry / Versioning]

  FE --> SCALE[Scaler load/apply | models/feature_scaler.joblib]
  SCALE --> S1[Stage1: Binary detector | model_stage1.joblib (RandomForest/LightGBM)]

  %% Stat/heuristic engine
  FE --> StatEngine[Stat engine | compute pkt_rate, syn_rate, dst_port_entropy]
  StatEngine --> SCORE[Compute attack_score | combine model_prob + stat_score]
  S1 --> SCORE

  SCORE --> DECIDE{attack_score >= threshold?}
  DECIDE -- No --> NORMAL[Normal | log / continue]
  DECIDE -- Yes --> S2[Stage2: Family classifier | model_stage2.joblib (LightGBM multiclass)]

  S2 --> FAMILY[attack_family + family_prob]

  %% Whitelist and policy
  FAMILY --> Whitelist[Whitelist check | configs/ids_config.yaml]
  Whitelist -- trusted --> NORMAL
  Whitelist -- not trusted --> LOGIC[Decision logic | consecutive windows, family policy, max_auto_block]

  LOGIC --> ACTION{Action}
  ACTION --> ALERT[Alert | MQTT / webhook]
  ACTION --> THROTTLE[Throttle | tc / iptables rate-limit]
  ACTION --> BLOCK[Block | ipset + iptables / nftables]

  %% Blockstore and cleanup
  BLOCK --> BlockStore[ipset / blockstore]
  BlockStore --> Cleanup[Cleanup worker | expiry remove]

  %% Forensics
  ACTION --> Forensics[PCAP capture (optional) | archive for analysis]

  %% Monitoring & operator
  ALERT --> Outputs[Logs / reports / Grafana / Loki]
  Outputs --> Operator[Operator UI / Manual override]
  Operator --> Unblock[Manual unblock / override]

  %% Model lifecycle & retrain
  EVAL[Evaluation / Drift detection | train/evaluate_ids_model.py] --> ModelRegistry
  ModelRegistry --> Retrain[Retrain scheduler / trigger]
  Retrain --> TRAIN

  %% Runtime service
  subgraph Runtime
    SVC[ids_gateway.main | systemd: ids_gateway.service]
  end
  SVC --> FE
  SVC --> SCALE
  SVC --> S1
  SVC --> S2
  SVC --> StatEngine
  SVC --> BlockStore

  %% Testing hooks
  A4 --> SVC
  DProcessed --> EVAL

  %% Metrics exporter
  SVC --> Metrics[Metrics exporter | Prometheus]
  Metrics --> Grafana[Grafana]

  %% Safety fallback
  Safety[Monitor-only / Fail-open] --> SVC
  SVC --> Safety
